        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-navy">SECTION 21</span>&nbsp; Does a lapsed CP12 affect a Section 21 notice in Wirral?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. A landlord who has not provided a valid gas safety certificate to their Wirral tenant may be unable to serve a valid Section 21 notice. Courts have ruled that CP12 compliance is a legal prerequisite for a valid Section 21. A lapsed or unserved certificate can prevent eviction proceedings entirely. Annual renewal and same-day forwarding to tenants protects your Section 21 position.</p></div></details>
